[Set up completions →](/cli/completions)

</div>
<div>
<span class="usage-feature-number" aria-hidden="true">02 / DOCUMENT</span>

### Make the reference repeatable

Turn help text and examples into Markdown pages and Unix manuals. Regenerate them
with each release to keep the reference aligned with your CLI.

[Generate documentation →](/cli/markdown)

</div>
<div>
<span class="usage-feature-number" aria-hidden="true">03 / AUTOMATE</span>

### Make your CLI easier to call

Give scripts argument parsing and help, or generate TypeScript and Python clients
that construct arguments and run your CLI as a subprocess.

[Add parsing to a script →](/cli/scripts) · [Generate an SDK →](/cli/sdk)

</div>
</div>

<div class="usage-start-section">
<div>
<p class="usage-eyebrow">Start with what you have</p>

